                                "sense_id": "ed8d7cda-440a-3407-8e92-121c5fecadf6",
                                "text": "At this point, South should have played a spade to dummy's ace, ruffed a spade and led her club king to catch West in a trump endplay, but she became flustered and lost two more tricks to go down one."
                            }
                        ]
